  "description": "From [Gourmet Scans](https://www.mangaupdates.com/groups.html?id=70765517392):  \nThe contract marriage between Hilia Richano, the Daughter of a Baron, and Duke Helios was built on two clear conditions: to repay the crushing debts burdening her family and to produce an heir for the ducal house.\n\nFive years later, the agreement comes to an end.\nOn the day they draft the divorce papers, Caligo finds himself unable to let Hilia go.\n\n\"...Fine, let’s say our marriage was just a contract.\nBut how can you not even try to see your own child.\"\n\n\"Do you believe that just because I gave birth to that child, I’m obligated to love it?\nThat child only exists because of the contract between you and me.\"\n\n\"At the very least... I thought of you as a friend.\nSo tell me, what was I to you.\"\n\n\"You were nothing to me.\nTake care, Your Grace.\"\n\nWith those final words, Hilia Richano walks away, leaving her child and family behind.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63224884), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9D%B4%ED%98%BC%ED%95%98%EA%B3%A0-%EA%B0%80%EC%A1%B1%EC%9D%84-%EB%B2%84%EB%A0%B8%EB%8B%A4/3888)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/158353)",
